%% RUNTIME_FLOW — runtime data/control flow, normal loop (06 §1c)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DEV as Device surfaces / kernel
    participant OBS as FX-OBS
    participant MDL as FX-MODEL
    participant POL as FX-POLICY
    participant SAFE as FX-SAFE
    participant ACT as FX-ACT/fxhelperd
    participant STO as FX-STORE

    DEV->>OBS: PSI trigger fires / lifecycle event / counter tick (≤1 Hz steady)
    OBS->>MDL: ObsEvent (IF-01)
    MDL->>MDL: update StateEstimate / PredictionSet (confidence, abstain)
    MDL-->>POL: change notification (IF-02)
    POL->>POL: region evaluation (hysteresis, dwell, rate, energy)
    alt intents needed
        POL->>SAFE: ActionIntent(s) (IF-03)
        SAFE->>SAFE: admission check (surface state ≥ required? consent tier? guards?)
        alt admitted
            SAFE->>ACT: admitted intent (IF-04)
            ACT->>DEV: schema command write (IF-05, privileged) or device_config
            ACT->>DEV: readback verify
            ACT->>STO: journal ACTUATION + READBACK (before/after)
        else rejected/expired
            SAFE->>STO: journal ADMISSION reject
        end
    else hold
        POL->>STO: decision log (no-op)
    end
    STO-->>OBS: (registry/config reads on demand)
